# Optional. All three contact forms already ship with a working Web3Forms
# (https://web3forms.com) access key baked into src/utils/forms.js, so
# enquiries send without any setup. Set this only to point enquiries at a
# different mailbox — get a key at web3forms.com after verifying the
# address that should receive them, and set the same value in Netlify →
# Site configuration → Environment variables.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
